---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import BrandMark from '../components/ui/BrandMark.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="认识一下" eyebrow="04 / ABOUT" english="About" description="关于这个名字，和这个正在生长的个人空间。" section="about">
  <div class="about-grid"><div class="brand-plate"><BrandMark /><strong>IC Aiming</strong><span class="mono">ICE COLD / I SEE / AIMING</span></div><section class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PIXELS</p><h2 data-profile-tagline>冷静观察，持续瞄准。</h2><p data-profile-bio class="muted">正在读取介绍…</p><a class="small-link" href="/resume">查看个人履历 ↗</a></section></div>
  <section class="brand-story"><div><span class="mono">01 / ICE COLD</span><h3>保持冷静</h3><p>IC 是 Ice Cold 的缩写。留一点冷静，给思考和判断腾出空间。</p></div><div><span class="mono">02 / I SEE</span><h3>看清楚一点</h3><p>IC 也是 “I see” 的谐音。先观察、理解，再决定如何行动。</p></div><div><span class="mono">03 / AIMING</span><h3>持续瞄准</h3><p>Aiming 是瞄准，也是名字的一部分。在探索中不断调整方向。</p></div></section>
  <section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">ELSEWHERE ON THE INTERNET</p><h2>在别处找到我</h2><p class="muted">欢迎交流技术、分享有趣的东西，或打个招呼。</p></div><div><a href="#contact" class="email-link" data-email-link data-email-text>正在读取邮箱…</a><div data-social-links class="social-links"></div></div></section>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0 60px; }.brand-plate { background: var(--soft); padding: 45px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); }.brand-plate :global(svg) { width: 130px; color: var(--accent); }.brand-plate strong { font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -.06em; font-weight: 550; }.brand-plate .mono { font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); }.about-copy h2 { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 500; }.about-copy>p:not(.eyebrow) { line-height: 2; }.brand-story { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; padding: 40px 0; }.brand-story .mono { font-size: 10px; color: var(--accent); }.brand-story h3 { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0 15px; }.brand-story p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; }.contact-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 35px; padding: 60px 0 0; }.contact-section h2 { font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500; }.contact-section p { font-size: 13px; }.email-link { font-size: clamp(19px, 2.5vw, 30px); display: inline-block; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 26px; letter-spacing: -.02em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  @media(max-width: 750px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; }.brand-plate { padding: 30px; }.brand-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }.contact-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } }
</style>
